==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Porygon2|156}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
*'''{{m|Sharpen}}''' is a [[move]] that [[Porygon2]] can learn on the [[main series]] Pokémon games as a [[Porygon]].
